OL,3,AChristmas 2026 stamps unveiled by Royal
OL,4,AMail
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoyal Mail has unveiled its Christmas
OL,7,Fstamps for this year - featuring scenes
OL,8,Ffrom the Nativity.
OL,10,FThe series of five stamps have been
OL,11,Fjointly created by graphic designer
OL,12,FGareth Howat and illustrator Rebecca
OL,13,FSutherland.
OL,15,FThe stamps depict familiar scenes of
OL,16,FMary and Joseph travelling, baby Jesus,
OL,17,Fan angel, the shepherds and the Three
OL,18,FWise Men.
OL,20,FThis year's collection marks the 60th
OL,21,Fanniversary of the first-ever Christmas
OL,22,Fspecial stamp.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
